4. Improved the component structure with proper Suspense handling
5. Added proper TypeScript types
6. Included error reporting in the console
7. Added some basic styling to make error messages more visible
8. Fixed the getTranslate mock function to return a function directly
9. Wrapped the component in a container with padding for better visibility

This should help resolve the dynamic import issue and provide better error handling. If you're still seeing issues, please let me know and I can help further diagnose the problem.

